# 2026-09-29 本机（广州电信；系统代理 127.0.0.1:7897，但 shell 无代理变量）4~6MB 采样实测：
#   npm tarball      registry.npmjs.org 63KB/s | registry.npmmirror.com 397KB/s | 腾讯镜像 204KB/s
#   electron zip     cdn.npmmirror.com 5.77MB/s | github release 1.03MB/s，走代理反而 24KB/s 超时
#   builder binaries cdn.npmmirror.com 4.32MB/s | github 直连超时、走代理 1.02MB/s
# 所以包与二进制全部走 npmmirror，代理只留给 GitHub 仓库操作。
registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com/

# @electron/get 与 electron-builder 读的是这两个 npm config 键（等价于同名大写环境变量）
electron_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/
electron_builder_binaries_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron-builder-binaries/
